# ledger.jsonl is an append-only log of independent one-line JSON rows, written
# concurrently from several worktrees. Union merge keeps every side's rows and
# never conflicts; the price is that ROW ORDER carries no meaning, which the
# ledger discipline (skill-lab) already requires: rows cite each other by
# `run`/`ts`, never by position.
ledger.jsonl merge=union
